# The Debian snapshot the engine stages take their pinned build packages from:
# the release and its updates and security pockets, at the moment the
# mica-build-env images (20261101-1044) install their own packages from. It
# must not be older than those images, or apt refuses to resolve downgrades
# against their packages. The Base apt rows (the root's snapshot) cannot be
# used for that reason; the runtime contract is kept by the declared Depends
# floors, which base-check verifies against the versions Base pins.
deb [check-valid-until=no] https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20261101T000000Z trixie main
deb [check-valid-until=no] https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian-security/20261101T000000Z trixie-security main
deb [check-valid-until=no] https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20261101T000000Z trixie-updates main
